{% block infra_blockers %}
These witnesses run against the proxy's own ASGI app and, where a real socket
is unavoidable, against listeners the test starts on loopback. They need no
cloud credentials, no external services, and no remote host. If a unit appears
to require one, that is a signal you are reaching past the observable surface:
reread the unit and find the claim you can make at the app boundary before
recording a blocker.
